# Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/wythnos.
# wythnos (feminine), plural wythnosau.  The entry states the word
# does not mutate in standard Welsh, so no mutated surface ships.
# A Welsh numeral is followed by the singular (or, for the year, its count
# form), so both the counted forms and the ordinary plural are surfaces of
# this unit.
wythnos
wythnosau
